WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.030
In 1962, Israel's Supreme
Court heard an unusual case.

2
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.720
A Catholic monk had been born Jewish.

3
00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:12.020
He asked Israel to recognise him
as a Jew under its Law of Return.

4
00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:14.030
The court said no.

5
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.020
So is being Jewish about
who your mother is,

6
00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:19.590
what you believe, or what you do?

7
00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:23.240
In this mission, you'll weigh
four answers that keep coming up:

8
00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:26.600
birth, faith, works and ritual.

9
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:30.310
Then you'll ask whether the Jews
are a people as well as a religion,

10
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.150
and what part faith and actions play.

11
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.880
Your mission: find out whether
being Jewish comes from your mother,

12
00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.840
your beliefs or your actions.
